<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-21T18:48:20.119Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 18:48:20 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen in Plateau killed NSCDC officer Distu Garba Audu and abducted a businessman, while separate gunmen attacks on herders in the same state left two dead and six injured. In Kaduna, bandits abducted five people including a one-month-old baby and demanded N10 million for the release of a teacher, and a fisherman reported his fingers were cut off. Troops arrested seven suspects over the herders attack and police freed a Catholic priest and seven other abductees in Benue. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxPZGdGZmg2TGpUNUxGRmptYXlpdHRQcUw0U045cUVoTUYyUGYzU25kbHY1Rm1IM2kwcy1QbjJGODRYMFVkdHBlbGpyZ19MMVduMnZ3NGRIUW9GMTBsSktDZHk1TXlnV3lBaWtULUhpNHExRWhjQkd1enRaMTN4TW1DYjNrWl91RTNMUzgxTER2MnBfVld5anZ2b00wOTAzUTZ5U1lObENPM3M5Zk5mY0pVT1VWazRUWDFuMnltbm9n?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sahara Reporters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMid0FVX3lxTE1fN0dBZml4dHgydGlmaFoycHpXZk9UMm12WXVBVEZoU0NJeWpMWG1LRVJjTjZjWGFjTjRfaXpvZllnRlJKQm5NVDRRUUdCZDRVTVlXVGE1djAxeUZwWkpTUWt1UWpZeUFfdVAwaFctMVFGR242YWVn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Trust&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxQRFhJYUQ2eHlVRUNTeTBRcTIyYk5ZcGRfTFc0eHdyZ2ZrS2RtUVFJdkpieXVHeFJfR25oOG5SUGhwNnUtYXNZSmdWbmFCaEREbC01YmZsM0dBa0hmN1I4REFhWE9MVjc5Sk1JeGdTZ2xGWnBoem8xRDhoai16bGR1WnhDb3pRb3Zvbmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;LEADERSHIP Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxOdjUtOENoOEhRb3JzVUI1UUJRQmJ0eXJiX2pQa3NDTjVyVVp1Y3JNV3BaVlkwV213ZlZjOVpzVmJYZG5tbU54Z0JGZnJVUHdaTm9QNHc0OVI2cnF4WWZwYnFFOW5DcXVDYnQ1ZGR4bkNFQW1rSGVIcEpseVhVVHQxUEd0ZXRtdTF2Qm5LNzA4aw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxNR2d4c1h3WmdYUW04